WEBVTT

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:17.760
Tonight on Frontline...

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.030
The material is classified, is still classified.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.770
Julian Assange...

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.130
To some people a hero, to other people a devil.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:27.640
Bradley Manning...

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.960
An idealistic young soldier who felt out of place.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.360
Bradley Manning was a troubled young man.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.780
Over half a million leaked documents.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.940
We don't really know whether Manning approached WikiLeaks

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.160
or it was the other way around.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.600
We had always feared that one of our potential sources

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:44.540
would be exposed.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:45.400
Tonight...

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.640
When you read the chat, it sounds like there is

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.080
some kind of connection with you.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.370
The whole story.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.700
We do not know whether Mr. Manning is our source or not.

00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:54.830
WikiSecrets.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:57.190
The best way to keep a secret is to never have it.

